name sdaps
category Package
revision 61017
shortdesc LaTeX support files for SDAPS
longdesc This bundle contains LaTeX classes and packages to create
longdesc machine readable questionnaires. Metadata is generated for the
longdesc whole document and it is possible to process created forms
longdesc fully automatically using the SDAPS main program. Features
longdesc include: PDF Form generation Advanced array like layouting Can
longdesc flow over multiple pages and repeats the header automatically
longdesc Optional document wide alignment of array environments Has
longdesc complex layout features like rotating the headers to safe space
longdesc Ability to exchange rows and columns on the fly Different
longdesc question types: Freeform text Single/multiple choice questions
longdesc Range questions Layouting questions in rows or columns
longdesc Possibility to pre-fill questionnaires from LaTeX
containersize 31996
